  "body": "## AI compatibility review\n\nI am an AI assistant reviewing this dependency update. This PR cannot be merged as-is:\n\n- The root `package-lock.json` is not updated from TypeScript 6.0.3 to 7.0.2, so `npm ci` first fails due to the lockfile/package manifest mismatch.\n- Regenerating the lockfile exposes a blocking peer-dependency conflict: `ts-jest@29.4.11` requires `typescript >=4.3 <7`, so root `npm ci` fails with `ERESOLVE`.\n- There is no stable `ts-jest` version supporting TypeScript 7. Its available TypeScript-7-compatible prerelease targets Jest 29, while this repository uses Jest 30.\n\nI did not push a lockfile-only change because it would leave CI un-installable. This update needs either stable TypeScript 7 support in ts-jest or a deliberate test-transformer/Jest migration.",
